  "notes": "CAD via the H.S.T. marker (F14) - and the H.S.T. number itself, 123142812RT0001, is gold-labelled tax_id that no selector below reads. That is registered extraction debt, not a deferral: scorecard.CHECKED_FIELDS asserts it and it fails every run until somebody writes the selector. 70+ sub-account identities (F13). The F8 refusal - 14,789.77 printed against 14,740.85 Please Pay, aging all zero, nothing on the page explaining the 48.92 - is DEFERRED under printed-fields-only: derive_amount_payable is in no adjust list, so this persona no longer produces amount_payable at all, null or otherwise. The refusal logic and its unit tests are still on disk.",
